{"id":"193137d919281dfb","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-group-law.md","title":"Group Law","display":"df-group-law — Group Law","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-group-law","aliases":["58-df-group-law"],"display":"df-group-law — Group Law","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-associative.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-group-law"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-group-law</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-group-law — Group Law"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b176dfebe3d3aef4\" href=\"?note=b176dfebe3d3aef4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-associative.md\">../batch04/58-df-associative.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in V\">\\(G\\in V\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*:G\\times G\\to G\">\\(*:G\\times G\\to G\\)</span> (operation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in G\">\\(e\\in G\\)</span> (identity candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupLaw}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupLaw}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (group-law predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Associative}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Associative}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (associativity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b176dfebe3d3aef4\" href=\"?note=b176dfebe3d3aef4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-associative.md\">../batch04/58-df-associative.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group\\text{-}law} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupLaw}_S(G,*,e) \\leftrightarrow *:G\\times G\\to G\\land e\\in G\\land \\mathrm{Associative}_S(G,*) \\land \\forall x\\in G\\;(e*x=x \\land x*e=x) \\land \\forall x\\in G\\;\\exists y\\in G\\;(x*y=e \\land y*x=e)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group\\text{-}law} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupLaw}_S(G,*,e) \\leftrightarrow *:G\\times G\\to G\\land e\\in G\\land \\mathrm{Associative}_S(G,*) \\land \\forall x\\in G\\;(e*x=x \\land x*e=x) \\land \\forall x\\in G\\;\\exists y\\in G\\;(x*y=e \\land y*x=e)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A group law is an associative operation with identity and inverses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-associative.md","status":"resolved","id":"b176dfebe3d3aef4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-associative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-associative.md","status":"resolved","id":"b176dfebe3d3aef4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Associative}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (associativity predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-associative.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"*:G\\times G\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupLaw}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Associative}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group\\text{-}law} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupLaw}_S(G,*,e) \\leftrightarrow *:G\\times G\\to G\\land e\\in G\\land \\mathrm{Associative}_S(G,*) \\land \\forall x\\in G\\;(e*x=x \\land x*e=x) \\land \\forall x\\in G\\;\\exists y\\in G\\;(x*y=e \\land y*x=e)","display":true}],"bytes":881,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-598","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-group-law.md|58-df-group-law]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["b176dfebe3d3aef4"]}